                    <details>Raw movies (*.tif), micrographs (averages/*.mrc), particle coordinates (matching/*.star), and extracted stack (particles/*.mrcs) for P-Rex-Gbg cryo-EM structure. All data with prefix "18jan18c" were collected on an untilted grid whereas data with the prefix "18aug03b" were collected on a grid with a tilt angle of 30 degrees. Uploaded data were preprocessed using Warp-1.0.5.

Original particle stack (905,464 particles): merge_18aug03b_18jan18c_goodparticles_Retrain1_BoxNet2Mask_20180531_2.star
Selected stack after 2D classification (611,231 particles): cryosparc_exp001001_202.star 
Final stack after 3D heterogeneous refinement (205,599 particles): cryosparc_exp001054_009.star
Warp re-trained model: Retrain1_BoxNet2Mask_20180531_2/
Gain reference for 18jan18c: 18jan18c_gain_reference_17133354_01_7420x7676_norm_0.mrc
Gain reference for 18aug03b: 18aug03b_gain_reference_02131216_05_3710x3838_norm_0.mrc

Kev=300
Cs=2.7
Pixel size=1A/pix
Untilted (18jan18c) total dose: 49.5 e/A2 (30 frames)
Tilted (18aug03b) total dose: 45 e/A2 (100 frames)</details>
